(4994716, 728682, 99263, '<td valign="top">You arranged this scene in a really classic sort of way. Very well done. The emerald greens of the forest and the gnarled old tree form a fantastic backdrop and the carpet of forest moss upon which they are seated adds to the overall sphere of enchantment. Your exposure was spot-on with nice shadows and details and the whites of the sleeping beauties dress are testimony to this. You achieved a nice and natural softness to the tones and colours.</td>', 'You arranged this scene in a really classic sort of way. Very well done. The emerald greens of the forest and the gnarled old tree form a fantastic backdrop and the carpet of forest moss upon which they are seated adds to the overall sphere of enchantment. Your exposure was spot-on with nice shadows and details and the whites of the sleeping beauties dress are testimony to this. You achieved a nice and natural softness to the tones and colours.', '2008-10-06 10:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
