(4995720, 728561, 94265, '<td valign="top">I love this crystal clear water shot but I think the reflection of whatever it is distracts from the water flow and the ripple. Would have prefered the water to have a more simple reflection.</td>', 'I love this crystal clear water shot but I think the reflection of whatever it is distracts from the water flow and the ripple. Would have prefered the water to have a more simple reflection.', '2008-10-06 20:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
