(4995849, 727703, 80096, '<td valign="top">Yes! I like this-- it has a definite feeling of the old Dutch masters about it. 10+</td>', 'Yes! I like this-- it has a definite feeling of the old Dutch masters about it. 10+', '2008-10-06 21:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
