(4996203, 728673, 68947, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colours, fantastic reflection, clear focus and sharp image.  Only criticism would be that the expression on the model''s face doesn''t seem to reflect "life"...it''s almost as though she''s going to snap at someone! *grin*</td>', 'Gorgeous colours, fantastic reflection, clear focus and sharp image.  Only criticism would be that the expression on the model''s face doesn''t seem to reflect "life"...it''s almost as though she''s going to snap at someone! *grin*', '2008-10-07 00:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
