(4996207, 728623, 68947, '<td valign="top">Love the simplistic look to this shot.  It fits the challenge well and the colours and focus are great!</td>', 'Love the simplistic look to this shot.  It fits the challenge well and the colours and focus are great!', '2008-10-07 00:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
