(4996211, 728513, 68947, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours, focus and clarity.  Not much of a fan of the darkening of the surrounding area.  Wondering if perhaps, a tighter crop might have been a better solution?</td>', 'Lovely colours, focus and clarity.  Not much of a fan of the darkening of the surrounding area.  Wondering if perhaps, a tighter crop might have been a better solution?', '2008-10-07 00:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
