(4996214, 728277, 68947, '<td valign="top">Cute! I''m not sure that the shot needed as much forest area as it has.  Perhaps, a bit tighter a crop to have a little more focus on Red Cap?</td>', 'Cute! I''m not sure that the shot needed as much forest area as it has.  Perhaps, a bit tighter a crop to have a little more focus on Red Cap?', '2008-10-07 00:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
