(4996251, 728701, 69668, '<td valign="top">She is a terrific Snow White.  I love her pose and expression.  I do wish the hands on the witch were a bit more creepy..and the hair was more gray.  I overall really like the image, very well done.</td>', 'She is a terrific Snow White.  I love her pose and expression.  I do wish the hands on the witch were a bit more creepy..and the hair was more gray.  I overall really like the image, very well done.', '2008-10-07 01:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
