(4996254, 727848, 69668, '<td valign="top">Great special effects.  I hope you share the details on how you accomplished this after the challenge ends.</td>', 'Great special effects.  I hope you share the details on how you accomplished this after the challenge ends.', '2008-10-07 01:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996415, 728170, 57775, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful and very magical looking.  Perhaps just a tad overprocessed in my opinion, but still nice. 8.</td>', 'This is beautiful and very magical looking.  Perhaps just a tad overprocessed in my opinion, but still nice. 8.', '2008-10-07 04:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996416, 728682, 57775, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites.  The quality of the post processing really adds to the surreal dreamlike feel.</td>', 'One of my favorites.  The quality of the post processing really adds to the surreal dreamlike feel.', '2008-10-07 04:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996417, 727703, 57775, '<td valign="top">One of the best in the bunch.  Looks like a painting.  Really well done.</td>', 'One of the best in the bunch.  Looks like a painting.  Really well done.', '2008-10-07 04:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996418, 728673, 57775, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  8</td>', 'Very nice composition.  8', '2008-10-07 04:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996419, 728615, 57775, '<td valign="top">I like the concept a lot and I can''t argue you have great lighting and good composition, but for some reason it seems like something is missing to me.  Maybe it would have been more authentic looking with a cool background like a stone wall lit by torches or something.</td>', 'I like the concept a lot and I can''t argue you have great lighting and good composition, but for some reason it seems like something is missing to me.  Maybe it would have been more authentic looking with a cool background like a stone wall lit by torches or something.', '2008-10-07 04:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996420, 727495, 57775, '<td valign="top">My favorite and the only 9 I gave in the challenge.  Beautiful shot and a lovely title that really tells a story.</td>', 'My favorite and the only 9 I gave in the challenge.  Beautiful shot and a lovely title that really tells a story.', '2008-10-07 04:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996421, 728277, 57775, '<td valign="top">I think this is the best of the red cap entries.  LOL, looks like she''s on her cell phone, which is kind of a cool twist even if it was unintentional.</td>', 'I think this is the best of the red cap entries.  LOL, looks like she''s on her cell phone, which is kind of a cool twist even if it was unintentional.', '2008-10-07 04:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996422, 728561, 57775, '<td valign="top">Great photo... I like the symbolism of the reflection of the clock in the water.</td>', 'Great photo... I like the symbolism of the reflection of the clock in the water.', '2008-10-07 04:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996423, 726370, 57775, '<td valign="top">Very, very cute.  I love the expression of the turtle.  Your subjects have great personality.  My only wish is that it had either a solid black background or a solid white one, or even better a nice brightly colored background.  This one just seems kind of haphazardly gray and distractingly textured.</td>', 'Very, very cute.  I love the expression of the turtle.  Your subjects have great personality.  My only wish is that it had either a solid black background or a solid white one, or even better a nice brightly colored background.  This one just seems kind of haphazardly gray and distractingly textured.', '2008-10-07 04:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996424, 728701, 57775, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image and well executed.  My only complaint is that it seems like you went just a touch too far with the softening / blur effect.  Otherwise I really like it.</td>', 'Beautiful image and well executed.  My only complaint is that it seems like you went just a touch too far with the softening / blur effect.  Otherwise I really like it.', '2008-10-07 04:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996427, 728515, 57775, '<td valign="top">LOL.. cute statue, but I really think this image could have benefitted from a nicer background - maybe if you had photographed it among some pretty flowers in a garden with nice sunset or sunrise lighting, it would have made it more interesting.  I also think I would''ve changed the eye color in photoshop.</td>', 'LOL.. cute statue, but I really think this image could have benefitted from a nicer background - maybe if you had photographed it among some pretty flowers in a garden with nice sunset or sunrise lighting, it would have made it more interesting.  I also think I would''ve changed the eye color in photoshop.', '2008-10-07 05:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996428, 728613, 57775, '<td valign="top">Huh?</td>', 'Huh?', '2008-10-07 05:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996429, 728629, 57775, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  I think I would have liked it even more with a shallower depth of field so that the background was blurred.</td>', 'Very pretty.  I think I would have liked it even more with a shallower depth of field so that the background was blurred.', '2008-10-07 05:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
