(4997914, 728123, 57775, '<td valign="top">I like your idea here, and the "spirit" effect is very well executed.  My only two complaints are 1) oversaturation and 2) I wish the model''s outfit looked a little less modern.  If he had been wearing a hooded black robe for example, it would have added mystery and authenticity to your shot. 6.</td>', 'I like your idea here, and the "spirit" effect is very well executed.  My only two complaints are 1) oversaturation and 2) I wish the model''s outfit looked a little less modern.  If he had been wearing a hooded black robe for example, it would have added mystery and authenticity to your shot. 6.', '2008-10-08 00:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997915, 728732, 57775, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  It conveys mystery and also has a surreal quality.  7.</td>', 'I really like this.  It conveys mystery and also has a surreal quality.  7.', '2008-10-08 00:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997918, 728080, 2490, '<td valign="top">Gory but very well done.  A little too much vignette.</td>', 'Gory but very well done.  A little too much vignette.', '2008-10-08 00:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997921, 727645, 57775, '<td valign="top">I like the way you''ve post processed only the background to look like a painting.  It''s as if the children have suddenly, inexplicably found themselves in a strange fantasy world.  7.</td>', 'I like the way you''ve post processed only the background to look like a painting.  It''s as if the children have suddenly, inexplicably found themselves in a strange fantasy world.  7.', '2008-10-08 00:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
