(4999487, 728123, 81530, '<td valign="top">Very well executed. Looks like an <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=36606" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">AlexSaberi</a> photograph.</td>', 'Very well executed. Looks like an  AlexSaberi photograph.', '2008-10-08 13:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
