(4999948, 727771, 75585, '<td valign="top">Wherever did you find such a great tree!!  Fantastic.  I like your lighting on this - it creates the appropriate mood of Hansel and Gretel and the fright of the night.</td>', 'Wherever did you find such a great tree!!  Fantastic.  I like your lighting on this - it creates the appropriate mood of Hansel and Gretel and the fright of the night.', '2008-10-08 15:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5000364, 728701, 30612, '<td valign="top">Enter your comment here, and then cast//www.dpchallenge.com/challenge_vote_image.php?IMAGE_ID=728701#<br/> 7  your vote...</td>', 'Enter your comment here, and then cast//www.dpchallenge.com/challenge_vote_image.php?IMAGE_ID=728701# 7  your vote...', '2008-10-08 19:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5000378, 728276, 94265, '<td valign="top">I really like the saturation effect on this, it''s a wee bit like an oil painting. The composition and props are really groovy.</td>', 'I really like the saturation effect on this, it''s a wee bit like an oil painting. The composition and props are really groovy.', '2008-10-08 19:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5000379, 728693, 94265, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture, very pretty bird and so sharply focused. I love the sunflower in the back, it does look a wee bit like it''s coming from the bird''s head but that aside, it''s a beautiful shot.</td>', 'Lovely capture, very pretty bird and so sharply focused. I love the sunflower in the back, it does look a wee bit like it''s coming from the bird''s head but that aside, it''s a beautiful shot.', '2008-10-08 19:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5000380, 728080, 94265, '<td valign="top">Morbid but in a humerous way! Very well done, is that a dog or a fur coat draped over something? The desaturation on everything but the red looks so good.</td>', 'Morbid but in a humerous way! Very well done, is that a dog or a fur coat draped over something? The desaturation on everything but the red looks so good.', '2008-10-08 19:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5000383, 728707, 90658, '<td valign="top">The angle of this makes it really hard to feel the entire story.  Your model has a great expression on her face, but since you are level (or perhaps slightly higher) then her head...it is getting lost.  Also, my eyes are drawn to the negative space above her arm.  I''m not sure if that is because the colors of everything else all demand attention and my brain can''t process them all at once, or if that is just where the focal point is.  <br/> <br/>I can tell that you and your model had loads of fun with this though...and isn''t enjoyment one of the reasons why you do this? :)</td>', 'The angle of this makes it really hard to feel the entire story.  Your model has a great expression on her face, but since you are level (or perhaps slightly higher) then her head...it is getting lost.  Also, my eyes are drawn to the negative space above her arm.  I''m not sure if that is because the colors of everything else all demand attention and my brain can''t process them all at once, or if that is just where the focal point is.   I can tell that you and your model had loads of fun with this though...and isn''t enjoyment one of the reasons why you do this? :)', '2008-10-08 19:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5000384, 728189, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''d have maybe toned down the blue just a skotch but otherwise, really nice shot, I like the way the light makes her look paler.</td>', 'I''d have maybe toned down the blue just a skotch but otherwise, really nice shot, I like the way the light makes her look paler.', '2008-10-08 19:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5000387, 728655, 90658, '<td valign="top">You know, this is the third time I''ve looked at this shot in full screen and it''s the first time I''ve seen the "wolf."  I''m not sure if that is a good thing or a bad thing.  The hyper-bright coloring of the doll causes eveything else to blend together...which is probably why I didn''t see the wolf until now.<br/> <br/>You probably could''ve left the doll out altogether and had a stunning photo (with some brightening of the foliage.)</td>', 'You know, this is the third time I''ve looked at this shot in full screen and it''s the first time I''ve seen the "wolf."  I''m not sure if that is a good thing or a bad thing.  The hyper-bright coloring of the doll causes eveything else to blend together...which is probably why I didn''t see the wolf until now. You probably could''ve left the doll out altogether and had a stunning photo (with some brightening of the foliage.)', '2008-10-08 19:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5000390, 728661, 90658, '<td valign="top">Really clever attempt at the abstract.  I just don''t get that "wow" factor from this.</td>', 'Really clever attempt at the abstract.  I just don''t get that "wow" factor from this.', '2008-10-08 19:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5000399, 728615, 90658, '<td valign="top">Absolutely wonderful!  The green eyes (jealousy), the blue eyes (innocent), the evil sneer captured at a perfect angle.  This is just stunning!!!!<br/> <br/>I am looking forward to your explanation of how you did this, my family and I have been arguing over the potential process ever since this came on the screen.<br/> <br/>A well-deserved 10!  And I sincerely hope a ribbon, as well.</td>', 'Absolutely wonderful!  The green eyes (jealousy), the blue eyes (innocent), the evil sneer captured at a perfect angle.  This is just stunning!!!! I am looking forward to your explanation of how you did this, my family and I have been arguing over the potential process ever since this came on the screen. A well-deserved 10!  And I sincerely hope a ribbon, as well.', '2008-10-08 19:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5000402, 727975, 90658, '<td valign="top">Extremely well captured nature shot.  The atonalities are wonderful.  The dof is perfect.  The framing of this animal by the branches.  Good job portraying a difficult fairy tale.</td>', 'Extremely well captured nature shot.  The atonalities are wonderful.  The dof is perfect.  The framing of this animal by the branches.  Good job portraying a difficult fairy tale.', '2008-10-08 19:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5000407, 727645, 90658, '<td valign="top">I personally love this.  You can tell the emotions of the children, the composition is fantastic.  but you went the extra step, and it is fabulous.  The way that you have processed the background trees gives this shot a mythical, "fairy" quality.  It communicates that this is fantasy, not reality.  But even better than that, you left the front alone which emphasizes the fact that the children are your subjects.<br/> <br/>Well done!</td>', 'I personally love this.  You can tell the emotions of the children, the composition is fantastic.  but you went the extra step, and it is fabulous.  The way that you have processed the background trees gives this shot a mythical, "fairy" quality.  It communicates that this is fantasy, not reality.  But even better than that, you left the front alone which emphasizes the fact that the children are your subjects. Well done!', '2008-10-08 20:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5000409, 727703, 90658, '<td valign="top">My first thought when I saw this..."this could be a painting."<br/> <br/>Eveything here is time period specific and it all fits.  Colors, lighting, emotion all are perfect for a Grimm tale.<br/> <br/>This is obviously Cinderella at the beginning of her life with her step-mother.</td>', 'My first thought when I saw this..."this could be a painting." Eveything here is time period specific and it all fits.  Colors, lighting, emotion all are perfect for a Grimm tale. This is obviously Cinderella at the beginning of her life with her step-mother.', '2008-10-08 20:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5000411, 728513, 90658, '<td valign="top">There is an interesting quality here.  There is the obvious intensity of the owl, but there is a bit of underlying humor...almost as if you caught him off-guard.  Nicely done.</td>', 'There is an interesting quality here.  There is the obvious intensity of the owl, but there is a bit of underlying humor...almost as if you caught him off-guard.  Nicely done.', '2008-10-08 20:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5000414, 728264, 90658, '<td valign="top">This is EXTREMELY haunting.  Very melancholy.  Which is exactly what Grimms'' tales are.  Dark, forboding, melancholy...grim.<br/> <br/>I am bumping this to a 9!</td>', 'This is EXTREMELY haunting.  Very melancholy.  Which is exactly what Grimms'' tales are.  Dark, forboding, melancholy...grim. I am bumping this to a 9!', '2008-10-08 20:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5000415, 727975, 94265, '<td valign="top">Very pretty shot, the light is lovely.</td>', 'Very pretty shot, the light is lovely.', '2008-10-08 20:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5000417, 728273, 90658, '<td valign="top">I love the green eyes against the reds of the lips and cape.  The fly-away hair adds some extra dimension.  My only thoughts are that the soft-focus, and the straight on shot makes it a bit difficult to differentiate her jaw line from her neck.  But that is a minor thing...imho, as this is one of the stellar shots in the bunch.</td>', 'I love the green eyes against the reds of the lips and cape.  The fly-away hair adds some extra dimension.  My only thoughts are that the soft-focus, and the straight on shot makes it a bit difficult to differentiate her jaw line from her neck.  But that is a minor thing...imho, as this is one of the stellar shots in the bunch.', '2008-10-08 20:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5000419, 728708, 90658, '<td valign="top">Such a tragic story.  Well conceived and executed.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Such a tragic story.  Well conceived and executed.  Nicely done.', '2008-10-08 20:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5000424, 727495, 90658, '<td valign="top">I read this story and there is no girl...except the princess and she wasn''t looking to find out what fear was.  That being said, I love this shot too much to let a little thing like that get in the way.<br/> <br/>As all Grimms'' tales are dark &amp; forboding, so is this shot.  You have captured a fantasy-like feeling with the long exposure and the b&amp;w presentation.  I saw this and I said "Wow!"  Only 3 shots got that response from me.<br/> <br/>My only thing is that it is tough to distinguish her head from the rock, but that is minor.</td>', 'I read this story and there is no girl...except the princess and she wasn''t looking to find out what fear was.  That being said, I love this shot too much to let a little thing like that get in the way. As all Grimms'' tales are dark & forboding, so is this shot.  You have captured a fantasy-like feeling with the long exposure and the b&w presentation.  I saw this and I said "Wow!"  Only 3 shots got that response from me. My only thing is that it is tough to distinguish her head from the rock, but that is minor.', '2008-10-08 20:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5000425, 727848, 90658, '<td valign="top">Extremely, well done!  Nice "darkness" as the story is dark.  But that blue just pops.  Looking forward to the explanation of how you did this.</td>', 'Extremely, well done!  Nice "darkness" as the story is dark.  But that blue just pops.  Looking forward to the explanation of how you did this.', '2008-10-08 20:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5000430, 728170, 90658, '<td valign="top">Ethereal, fairy-like, mystical, fantasy-esque, melancholy with a hint of hope, soft yet not "frou-ffy."  Well designed and captured presentation of this story.  If I were a betting woman, I''d say this was Judi.  So if you''re not Judi you just got a great compliment...well even if you are Judi you just got a great compliment.</td>', 'Ethereal, fairy-like, mystical, fantasy-esque, melancholy with a hint of hope, soft yet not "frou-ffy."  Well designed and captured presentation of this story.  If I were a betting woman, I''d say this was Judi.  So if you''re not Judi you just got a great compliment...well even if you are Judi you just got a great compliment.', '2008-10-08 20:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5000467, 728734, 40718, '<td valign="top">Someone''s been eating at McDonalds...</td>', 'Someone''s been eating at McDonalds...', '2008-10-08 20:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
