(5000534, 728277, 50695, '<td valign="top">LRC on her cell: yo gramma, I''m running a little late, had to pick some flowers.<br/> <br/>BBW aka Gramma MC: yo, no worries, take yo time, no hurry, I made peas and curry.<br/> <br/>LRC on her cell: my, what bitchin rhymes you have, gramma.<br/> <br/>BBW aka Gramma MC: the better to rap you with, my homeslice</td>', 'LRC on her cell: yo gramma, I''m running a little late, had to pick some flowers. BBW aka Gramma MC: yo, no worries, take yo time, no hurry, I made peas and curry. LRC on her cell: my, what bitchin rhymes you have, gramma. BBW aka Gramma MC: the better to rap you with, my homeslice', '2008-10-08 21:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
