(5000982, 727848, 76430, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo.  I like the overall blue theme and the bubbles in the bottle.  I''d like to see how you did this.  I''d like to see the spirit a little sharper, but maybe spirits aren''t that sharp after all.</td>', 'Interesting photo.  I like the overall blue theme and the bubbles in the bottle.  I''d like to see how you did this.  I''d like to see the spirit a little sharper, but maybe spirits aren''t that sharp after all.', '2008-10-09 02:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
