(5000985, 728710, 76430, '<td valign="top">Beautifully laid out with a very beautiful girl.  I thought it had given her warts until I realized it was flowers against her skin.  I think if she was holding the frog face to face with her and closer to her puckered lips it would help it.</td>', 'Beautifully laid out with a very beautiful girl.  I thought it had given her warts until I realized it was flowers against her skin.  I think if she was holding the frog face to face with her and closer to her puckered lips it would help it.', '2008-10-09 02:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5000988, 727495, 76430, '<td valign="top">It really has a moving water feeling to it, and looks like it''s all draining between the rocks.  I wonder how you got the time exposure in the foreground but have a fairly sharp wave break in the background.</td>', 'It really has a moving water feeling to it, and looks like it''s all draining between the rocks.  I wonder how you got the time exposure in the foreground but have a fairly sharp wave break in the background.', '2008-10-09 02:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
