(5001303, 728655, 73235, '<td valign="top">I believe your composition let you down in this pic. While it''s a good idea to include the wolf in the background, did you consider changing the POV? May be a view from over the wolf''s head onto her might have changed the perspective. And if you then focused on his head, blurring out the girl, it might not have been so obvious that she is a puppet? Just ideas to play with.</td>', 'I believe your composition let you down in this pic. While it''s a good idea to include the wolf in the background, did you consider changing the POV? May be a view from over the wolf''s head onto her might have changed the perspective. And if you then focused on his head, blurring out the girl, it might not have been so obvious that she is a puppet? Just ideas to play with.', '2008-10-09 10:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5001307, 728025, 73235, '<td valign="top">The harsh light makes your picture appear flat. May I make an other suggestions? Watch out for small details such as the one fern branch sticking right out of her head. These little things draw the attention of the view away from what you want us to focus on.</td>', 'The harsh light makes your picture appear flat. May I make an other suggestions? Watch out for small details such as the one fern branch sticking right out of her head. These little things draw the attention of the view away from what you want us to focus on.', '2008-10-09 10:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
