(5001990, 728684, 35513, '<td valign="top">I like the angle of this shot quite a bit, and the model looks very much like Snow White!  If I was going to nitpick, I would say that the apple would have more of an impact in the shot if it weren''t obstructed by some stray strands of grass.  Nice shot!</td>', 'I like the angle of this shot quite a bit, and the model looks very much like Snow White!  If I was going to nitpick, I would say that the apple would have more of an impact in the shot if it weren''t obstructed by some stray strands of grass.  Nice shot!', '2008-10-09 18:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5001992, 727848, 35513, '<td valign="top">Woah!  Cool idea!!</td>', 'Woah!  Cool idea!!', '2008-10-09 18:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5001994, 728283, 35513, '<td valign="top">The lighting really makes this an interesting shot, and IMO gives it a very fairytale look!  Well done!</td>', 'The lighting really makes this an interesting shot, and IMO gives it a very fairytale look!  Well done!', '2008-10-09 18:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5001996, 727993, 35513, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Nice setup work!!</td>', 'Wow!  Nice setup work!!', '2008-10-09 18:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5001998, 727771, 35513, '<td valign="top">Great expression on the girl''s face and what a wonderful setting for this story!</td>', 'Great expression on the girl''s face and what a wonderful setting for this story!', '2008-10-09 18:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5002000, 728560, 35513, '<td valign="top">Great expression on the little girl! :-)  I like the use of soft lighting and the colors of this shot really make it idyllic.</td>', 'Great expression on the little girl! :-)  I like the use of soft lighting and the colors of this shot really make it idyllic.', '2008-10-09 18:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5002001, 728672, 35513, '<td valign="top">LOVE the texture in this shot!</td>', 'LOVE the texture in this shot!', '2008-10-09 18:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5002002, 728513, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp detail!</td>', 'Nice crisp detail!', '2008-10-09 18:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5002003, 728490, 35513, '<td valign="top">Well done!  Love the muted tones in this shot.  Extremely well executed.</td>', 'Well done!  Love the muted tones in this shot.  Extremely well executed.', '2008-10-09 18:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5002006, 728025, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very cute Red Riding Hood!!  Desaturation really brings attention to the red--nice touch.</td>', 'Very cute Red Riding Hood!!  Desaturation really brings attention to the red--nice touch.', '2008-10-09 19:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5002007, 728739, 35513, '<td valign="top">Fantastic portrait with great expressions!!</td>', 'Fantastic portrait with great expressions!!', '2008-10-09 19:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5002009, 728581, 35513, '<td valign="top">The post processing really makes this stand out!  Nicely done.</td>', 'The post processing really makes this stand out!  Nicely done.', '2008-10-09 19:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5002011, 727840, 35513, '<td valign="top">A little more light might help bring out some more details in this shot?</td>', 'A little more light might help bring out some more details in this shot?', '2008-10-09 19:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5002013, 728674, 35513, '<td valign="top">Cute take on this challenge :-)  Nicely done!</td>', 'Cute take on this challenge :-)  Nicely done!', '2008-10-09 19:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5002014, 728273, 35513, '<td valign="top">Love the interplay between the hair and the hood here!!</td>', 'Love the interplay between the hair and the hood here!!', '2008-10-09 19:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5002016, 728073, 35513, '<td valign="top">Great expression!</td>', 'Great expression!', '2008-10-09 19:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5002017, 728080, 35513, '<td valign="top">Hehehe :-)  Nicely done!</td>', 'Hehehe :-)  Nicely done!', '2008-10-09 19:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5002018, 728665, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice modern take on the "tower"!  Cool idea</td>', 'Nice modern take on the "tower"!  Cool idea', '2008-10-09 19:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5002019, 727495, 35513, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!!  A 10 from me :-)</td>', 'Beautiful!!!  A 10 from me :-)', '2008-10-09 19:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5002020, 728597, 35513, '<td valign="top">Cute idea :-)</td>', 'Cute idea :-)', '2008-10-09 19:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5002021, 728170, 35513, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done!</td>', 'Beautifully done!', '2008-10-09 19:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5002052, 728581, 57775, '<td valign="top">I love the set up... you obviously put some good work into the witch''s costume and makeup.  Unfortunately for me the post processing is overdone and it has become too cartoonish looking.</td>', 'I love the set up... you obviously put some good work into the witch''s costume and makeup.  Unfortunately for me the post processing is overdone and it has become too cartoonish looking.', '2008-10-09 19:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5002423, 727840, 99396, '<td valign="top">UR SOOOOOO GOOD!</td>', 'UR SOOOOOO GOOD!', '2008-10-10 05:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5002577, 727495, 54478, '<td valign="top">Great photo. The water adds a lot of movement to the photo.</td>', 'Great photo. The water adds a lot of movement to the photo.', '2008-10-10 09:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5002585, 728024, 38846, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast, this photo stands out!</td>', 'I love the contrast, this photo stands out!', '2008-10-10 09:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5002721, 728742, 62187, '<td valign="top">You kinda went the same route as I did with my photo for this challenge. I even thought of using this story title for my photo but choose a different one in the end. The ''Schauvaffen Land'' story was a real trip! So, I hope your photo is not getting bashed like mine is. Your photo is of better quality then mine and I don''t think mine is a 10 by any means. But, it''s not a 4 either but the voters think it is. I think your photo is beautiful and it fits the challenge: 10</td>', 'You kinda went the same route as I did with my photo for this challenge. I even thought of using this story title for my photo but choose a different one in the end. The ''Schauvaffen Land'' story was a real trip! So, I hope your photo is not getting bashed like mine is. Your photo is of better quality then mine and I don''t think mine is a 10 by any means. But, it''s not a 4 either but the voters think it is. I think your photo is beautiful and it fits the challenge: 10', '2008-10-10 11:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5002946, 727771, 83313, '<td valign="top">I think you captured the mood well. They look alone and scared.  I noticed a little JPEG artifacting around the girls face and looked at the file size. 64k. You probably lost some detail due to compression. Fortunately it''s not very noticeable and I am sure to be the only one to mention it.</td>', 'I think you captured the mood well. They look alone and scared.  I noticed a little JPEG artifacting around the girls face and looked at the file size. 64k. You probably lost some detail due to compression. Fortunately it''s not very noticeable and I am sure to be the only one to mention it.', '2008-10-10 14:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5002949, 728276, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m not caring for it, but I don''t know why. It''s not bad by any means, but not appealing to me either.</td>', 'I''m not caring for it, but I don''t know why. It''s not bad by any means, but not appealing to me either.', '2008-10-10 14:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5002952, 728709, 83313, '<td valign="top">That this is clearly a statue outside a football stadium makes it more of a shoehorn than my own entry. Nice texture showing on it however, and an interesting angle.</td>', 'That this is clearly a statue outside a football stadium makes it more of a shoehorn than my own entry. Nice texture showing on it however, and an interesting angle.', '2008-10-10 14:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5002963, 728283, 83313, '<td valign="top">I can always identify another PSP user by the borders used. I need to locate some new ones, or learn how to make a frame file.<br/> <br/>The blue tone works, and has a storybook feel to it, except for the bright area at the top that shows this lion is in the shade.</td>', 'I can always identify another PSP user by the borders used. I need to locate some new ones, or learn how to make a frame file. The blue tone works, and has a storybook feel to it, except for the bright area at the top that shows this lion is in the shade.', '2008-10-10 15:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5002965, 728540, 83313, '<td valign="top">Simple and to the point. Like it.</td>', 'Simple and to the point. Like it.', '2008-10-10 15:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5002970, 728710, 83313, '<td valign="top">What <b>IS</b> this frog''s problem?! You should have asked me to help. *Ribbitt*</td>', 'What IS this frog''s problem?! You should have asked me to help. *Ribbitt*', '2008-10-10 15:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5002983, 728581, 83313, '<td valign="top">A little heavy on the tone mapping, but I suppose the look is appropriate for the theme.</td>', 'A little heavy on the tone mapping, but I suppose the look is appropriate for the theme.', '2008-10-10 15:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5002992, 727840, 83313, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s an optical illusion, but I don''t see a little old lady, I see the face of a dog wearing a shawl. Maybe it is and I just need to read the story? Googled it, and found some references to it, but not the actual story.</td>', 'Maybe it''s an optical illusion, but I don''t see a little old lady, I see the face of a dog wearing a shawl. Maybe it is and I just need to read the story? Googled it, and found some references to it, but not the actual story.', '2008-10-10 15:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5002995, 728025, 83313, '<td valign="top">Awww, she''s a little cutie.</td>', 'Awww, she''s a little cutie.', '2008-10-10 15:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5002997, 728134, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems a little blurred, though that may be intentional on your part.</td>', 'Seems a little blurred, though that may be intentional on your part.', '2008-10-10 15:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003044, 727975, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  I like the color tone.  Is there supposed to be two animals here?</td>', 'Nice capture.  I like the color tone.  Is there supposed to be two animals here?', '2008-10-10 15:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003049, 728734, 30049, '<td valign="top">Looks like that shoehorn has been used as a screwdriver a time or two.  :-)  Yep, it''s a shoehorned entry (kinda)...probably will score better than a handful out there.  Good luck.</td>', 'Looks like that shoehorn has been used as a screwdriver a time or two.  :-)  Yep, it''s a shoehorned entry (kinda)...probably will score better than a handful out there.  Good luck.', '2008-10-10 15:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003054, 728674, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the soft PP used in this.  A bit outside the box I think.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like the soft PP used in this.  A bit outside the box I think.  Good luck.', '2008-10-10 15:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003055, 728273, 30049, '<td valign="top">This would be a stronger scorer if the focus was there...it''s a bit blurry.</td>', 'This would be a stronger scorer if the focus was there...it''s a bit blurry.', '2008-10-10 15:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003059, 728655, 30049, '<td valign="top">With SO many people choosing this theme, and using real people, I imagine you''re having a little trouble with the score on this one.  On technical points the photo is crisp and well-lit.  Probably could use a little more space below the shows (feels crowded).  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'With SO many people choosing this theme, and using real people, I imagine you''re having a little trouble with the score on this one.  On technical points the photo is crisp and well-lit.  Probably could use a little more space below the shows (feels crowded).  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-10-10 15:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003064, 728515, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very effective bg choice.  Statues, figurines, dolls, etc...usually don''t score that well unless they''re an exceptional entry.  You have done a nice job in lighting this and getting a well focused image.  Good luck!</td>', 'Very effective bg choice.  Statues, figurines, dolls, etc...usually don''t score that well unless they''re an exceptional entry.  You have done a nice job in lighting this and getting a well focused image.  Good luck!', '2008-10-10 15:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003070, 728707, 30049, '<td valign="top">Kinda funny, but very contrived.  I know, most of the entries in a fairy tale challenge are going to be contrived, but not all of them look that way.  I guess it''s the props (fake frog and the yellow ball) that make this feel gimmicky.  Her expression is fun, the lighting and glare on her costume is a little strong.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Kinda funny, but very contrived.  I know, most of the entries in a fairy tale challenge are going to be contrived, but not all of them look that way.  I guess it''s the props (fake frog and the yellow ball) that make this feel gimmicky.  Her expression is fun, the lighting and glare on her costume is a little strong.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-10-10 15:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003074, 728080, 30049, '<td valign="top">Well processed and a clever idea - albeit a little strong on the gross factor for me personally.  Good luck.</td>', 'Well processed and a clever idea - albeit a little strong on the gross factor for me personally.  Good luck.', '2008-10-10 15:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003075, 728513, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this guy somewhere before. ???  Great clarity in the eyes.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''ve seen this guy somewhere before. ???  Great clarity in the eyes.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-10-10 15:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003078, 728552, 30049, '<td valign="top">A tad bit ho-hummish for me...nothing here to settle in with I guess is what I''m trying to say.  Sorry.</td>', 'A tad bit ho-hummish for me...nothing here to settle in with I guess is what I''m trying to say.  Sorry.', '2008-10-10 15:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003081, 728025, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute photo of the girl.  I can understand why you chose to desat, but another location where that wasn''t needed may have worked better.  All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck!</td>', 'Cute photo of the girl.  I can understand why you chose to desat, but another location where that wasn''t needed may have worked better.  All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck!', '2008-10-10 15:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003083, 728699, 30049, '<td valign="top">Neat idea and the dark bg works fine.  The goose looks to have been (prior to post-processing) a tad blown out.  Now it looks blown out and golden.  :-)</td>', 'Neat idea and the dark bg works fine.  The goose looks to have been (prior to post-processing) a tad blown out.  Now it looks blown out and golden.  :-)', '2008-10-10 15:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003084, 728661, 30049, '<td valign="top">Sorry, a bit too bizzare for me.</td>', 'Sorry, a bit too bizzare for me.', '2008-10-10 16:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003088, 728283, 30049, '<td valign="top">Color seems off.  A bluish cast in the "face".  Personally I don''t mind the border, but you''re going to knocked around a bit on that.  Good luck.</td>', 'Color seems off.  A bluish cast in the "face".  Personally I don''t mind the border, but you''re going to knocked around a bit on that.  Good luck.', '2008-10-10 16:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003089, 728708, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ewwwww - that''s somewhat gross.</td>', 'Ewwwww - that''s somewhat gross.', '2008-10-10 16:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003091, 728560, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful portrait.  Not sure how well it''s going to go over in the "story" department with the majority of voters...  Good luck.</td>', 'Wonderful portrait.  Not sure how well it''s going to go over in the "story" department with the majority of voters...  Good luck.', '2008-10-10 16:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003092, 728232, 30049, '<td valign="top">An "ok" landscape type shot.  Little strong on the contrast (time of day perhaps).  I''d desat the blues a tad and try giving this a soft dreamy glow.</td>', 'An "ok" landscape type shot.  Little strong on the contrast (time of day perhaps).  I''d desat the blues a tad and try giving this a soft dreamy glow.', '2008-10-10 16:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003096, 727495, 66201, '<td valign="top">A truly masterful shot - if this places anywhere below 4th place it will be under-rated. You have captured a sense of mystery and fearsomeness in this shot. I am amazed at how her hair and arms remain crisp with the slow shutter speed that has created the water effect. The movement in the water has the effect of sucking the viewer into the picture - pulling and drawing into itself, while she seems so delicate and fragile in contrast. Lovely, bold move to go B+W in an otherwise colourful, over-saturated challenge.</td>', 'A truly masterful shot - if this places anywhere below 4th place it will be under-rated. You have captured a sense of mystery and fearsomeness in this shot. I am amazed at how her hair and arms remain crisp with the slow shutter speed that has created the water effect. The movement in the water has the effect of sucking the viewer into the picture - pulling and drawing into itself, while she seems so delicate and fragile in contrast. Lovely, bold move to go B+W in an otherwise colourful, over-saturated challenge.', '2008-10-10 16:05:44.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5003097, 728710, 66201, '<td valign="top">Very pretty composition. Personally would have liked to see her eyes, but I realise this would have been awkward, given that she is looking at the frog.</td>', 'Very pretty composition. Personally would have liked to see her eyes, but I realise this would have been awkward, given that she is looking at the frog.', '2008-10-10 16:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003098, 728673, 30049, '<td valign="top">If this isn''t a Larus shot it''s certainly a good copycat.  Nice to have attractive models available for sure!</td>', 'If this isn''t a Larus shot it''s certainly a good copycat.  Nice to have attractive models available for sure!', '2008-10-10 16:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003101, 728561, 30049, '<td valign="top">If I wasn''t so tired of seeing water drops, splashes, drips, dunks, etc... I''d probably really like this shot.  I do like the color tones and it''s certainly well focused and illuminated.  Good luck.</td>', 'If I wasn''t so tired of seeing water drops, splashes, drips, dunks, etc... I''d probably really like this shot.  I do like the color tones and it''s certainly well focused and illuminated.  Good luck.', '2008-10-10 16:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003103, 727771, 66201, '<td valign="top">Amazing setting. and great focal lighting on the two of them.</td>', 'Amazing setting. and great focal lighting on the two of them.', '2008-10-10 16:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003105, 728209, 66201, '<td valign="top">a real prince charming to sit so still for you!! Amazing.</td>', 'a real prince charming to sit so still for you!! Amazing.', '2008-10-10 16:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003107, 728581, 66201, '<td valign="top">Very scary ... not sure how you''ve done this. This is the third time I''ve come back to look at this and have been wondering what it is about the image: now I see the strange "painted" leaves and background which give it a picture-book quality. Intriguing.</td>', 'Very scary ... not sure how you''ve done this. This is the third time I''ve come back to look at this and have been wondering what it is about the image: now I see the strange "painted" leaves and background which give it a picture-book quality. Intriguing.', '2008-10-10 16:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003108, 728283, 66201, '<td valign="top">Great processing. Amazing frame.He has such sad, wise eyes.</td>', 'Great processing. Amazing frame.He has such sad, wise eyes.', '2008-10-10 16:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003110, 727735, 66201, '<td valign="top">fantastic setting - lovely dreamlike feel with the soft focus ring. Interesting approach to shoot from behind - creates a greater sense of danger as she seems so vulnerable.</td>', 'fantastic setting - lovely dreamlike feel with the soft focus ring. Interesting approach to shoot from behind - creates a greater sense of danger as she seems so vulnerable.', '2008-10-10 16:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003112, 728682, 66201, '<td valign="top">Hmmm beautiful image and setting. But your subjects are sooo young that I find it hard to see them as lovers/a prince suitor...<br/> <br/>Great processing!</td>', 'Hmmm beautiful image and setting. But your subjects are sooo young that I find it hard to see them as lovers/a prince suitor... Great processing!', '2008-10-10 16:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003113, 728277, 66201, '<td valign="top">She looks soooo tiny in the setting - really creates a sense of her vulnerabltiy. Lovely pick ups in the yellow leaf litter and sunflowers. Also like the dull light.</td>', 'She looks soooo tiny in the setting - really creates a sense of her vulnerabltiy. Lovely pick ups in the yellow leaf litter and sunflowers. Also like the dull light.', '2008-10-10 16:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003117, 728540, 66201, '<td valign="top">Love the red against the blue. Perhaps a bit too "light",</td>', 'Love the red against the blue. Perhaps a bit too "light",', '2008-10-10 16:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003119, 728073, 66201, '<td valign="top">Great tones and textures, although the visible knee makes her look as if she is wearing a night dress, or ruins the olde worlde effect since in the stories I''ve not ever seen her wearing a dress above the knee... personally would have cropped to just at the base of the basket.</td>', 'Great tones and textures, although the visible knee makes her look as if she is wearing a night dress, or ruins the olde worlde effect since in the stories I''ve not ever seen her wearing a dress above the knee... personally would have cropped to just at the base of the basket.', '2008-10-10 16:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003123, 727815, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good model for Snow White, although I may have selected a pastel of lighter color for the dress.  Her face is OOF but not by much.  A much shallower DOF and positioning her hand a little closer to the camera would have been more effective IMO.  Image feels a little flat like it could use a boost in contrast and a tweak in levels.  All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Good model for Snow White, although I may have selected a pastel of lighter color for the dress.  Her face is OOF but not by much.  A much shallower DOF and positioning her hand a little closer to the camera would have been more effective IMO.  Image feels a little flat like it could use a boost in contrast and a tweak in levels.  All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-10-10 16:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003133, 728024, 30049, '<td valign="top">He-he.  Ok-dokie...</td>', 'He-he.  Ok-dokie...', '2008-10-10 16:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003136, 728490, 30049, '<td valign="top">Well focused portrait.  Perhaps a tad oversharpened.  Not familiar with the selected story.</td>', 'Well focused portrait.  Perhaps a tad oversharpened.  Not familiar with the selected story.', '2008-10-10 16:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003139, 728057, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok - you entered something, eh?  :-)  It''s "ok" as a photo I guess, but not very strong on the "story" board.  JMO.  Good luck.</td>', 'Ok - you entered something, eh?  :-)  It''s "ok" as a photo I guess, but not very strong on the "story" board.  JMO.  Good luck.', '2008-10-10 16:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003330, 728682, 95101, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. I really like how the forest in the background looks ethereal. Looks also like the little girl would have made a great Rapunzel with that super long hair ;)</td>', 'Beautiful shot. I really like how the forest in the background looks ethereal. Looks also like the little girl would have made a great Rapunzel with that super long hair ;)', '2008-10-10 19:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003339, 728710, 95101, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, really like all the colors and detail.</td>', 'Lovely shot, really like all the colors and detail.', '2008-10-10 19:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003878, 728561, 97073, '<td valign="top">Really good shot! Shame, perhaps, that the very edge of the splash is cut off but an 8 from me =]</td>', 'Really good shot! Shame, perhaps, that the very edge of the splash is cut off but an 8 from me =]', '2008-10-11 10:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003886, 728434, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice detail on the bee. I like the few stripes of white in the background, looks better than if it''d been all the one colour of green, it breaks it up a bit having different shades. Like the crop on the flower too.</td>', 'Nice detail on the bee. I like the few stripes of white in the background, looks better than if it''d been all the one colour of green, it breaks it up a bit having different shades. Like the crop on the flower too.', '2008-10-11 10:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003887, 728513, 94265, '<td valign="top">Great sharpness, love the central composition.</td>', 'Great sharpness, love the central composition.', '2008-10-11 10:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003888, 728742, 94265, '<td valign="top">Pretty scenery, love the different coloured foliage.</td>', 'Pretty scenery, love the different coloured foliage.', '2008-10-11 10:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003889, 726988, 94265, '<td valign="top">Background is a wee bit busy but the focus and light on the web are great.</td>', 'Background is a wee bit busy but the focus and light on the web are great.', '2008-10-11 10:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003890, 728386, 94265, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity and the contrast with the brown and gold.</td>', 'I like the simplicity and the contrast with the brown and gold.', '2008-10-11 10:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
