(5005409, 728283, 65234, '<td valign="top">My goodness, that was yet another story I''ve not read before.  Rough life for poor Lily, I must say.  Not sure why your lion is blue; maybe this was taken before his Lily found him again?  Might be too subtle.  I suspect a golden lion would score better and probably better represent his lion incarnation.  So I''d either do this in B&amp;W or maybe sepia, or hue-shift him to gold.</td>', 'My goodness, that was yet another story I''ve not read before.  Rough life for poor Lily, I must say.  Not sure why your lion is blue; maybe this was taken before his Lily found him again?  Might be too subtle.  I suspect a golden lion would score better and probably better represent his lion incarnation.  So I''d either do this in B&W or maybe sepia, or hue-shift him to gold.', '2008-10-12 20:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
