(5005643, 728123, 94265, '<td valign="top">I wanted to do this story but knew there would be shots like this that it would pale in comparison to! This is fantastic, I look forward to seeing how you did it. I love your setting too, with the old leaning tree and the orange sky in back. Great job!</td>', 'I wanted to do this story but knew there would be shots like this that it would pale in comparison to! This is fantastic, I look forward to seeing how you did it. I love your setting too, with the old leaning tree and the orange sky in back. Great job!', '2008-10-12 22:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5005644, 728615, 94265, '<td valign="top">This looks brilliant, great lighting. If I were you I''d have held my right hand more straight-on and less to the side, to really make it look like you''re holding a hand-held mirror. The position of your hand makes it obvious to me that it''s a photo frame and doesn''t have a handle. Other than that minor detail, this is awesome and think it''ll do very well.</td>', 'This looks brilliant, great lighting. If I were you I''d have held my right hand more straight-on and less to the side, to really make it look like you''re holding a hand-held mirror. The position of your hand makes it obvious to me that it''s a photo frame and doesn''t have a handle. Other than that minor detail, this is awesome and think it''ll do very well.', '2008-10-12 22:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5005647, 728490, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is so haunting my stomach actually flipped, I wasn''t gonna comment til tomorrow but I have to say, this really made an impact. Maybe it''s the open stare, or the fact she''s so pale that she appears dead, even though she''s clearly alive by those eyes. Wow. Great job.</td>', 'This is so haunting my stomach actually flipped, I wasn''t gonna comment til tomorrow but I have to say, this really made an impact. Maybe it''s the open stare, or the fact she''s so pale that she appears dead, even though she''s clearly alive by those eyes. Wow. Great job.', '2008-10-12 22:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
