(5005891, 727495, 86331, '<td valign="top">Now this is art. This photo has such an impact at first sight. I love it. I can''t believe anyone would give this anything less than an 8 really. But that''s just my opinion. I think this is a very well deserved 1st place, and I can''t say much about this photo other than it''s going into my favorites. Very well done and congratulations.</td>', 'Now this is art. This photo has such an impact at first sight. I love it. I can''t believe anyone would give this anything less than an 8 really. But that''s just my opinion. I think this is a very well deserved 1st place, and I can''t say much about this photo other than it''s going into my favorites. Very well done and congratulations.', '2008-10-13 01:02:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5005892, 727495, 80096, '<td valign="top">Fantastic job and well deserved! It''s good the water was only ankle deep-- you had me wondering, LOL!</td>', 'Fantastic job and well deserved! It''s good the water was only ankle deep-- you had me wondering, LOL!', '2008-10-13 01:03:51.000000', NULL, 0),
