(5005894, 727495, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is very beautiful.  I feel like the soft water is flowing right at me.  Gorgeous lighting and great sky.  Congrats on the blue ribbon and your new personal best!</td>', 'This is very beautiful.  I feel like the soft water is flowing right at me.  Gorgeous lighting and great sky.  Congrats on the blue ribbon and your new personal best!', '2008-10-13 01:03:55.000000', NULL, 0),
