(5005900, 727993, 67697, '<td valign="top">I thought this might have been you :D  This was one of my 10s as well.  Should have finished higher.  It looks like it came right out of a storybook.  Excellent job with the setup and processing.  This is a very cool shot for the challenge.</td>', 'I thought this might have been you :D  This was one of my 10s as well.  Should have finished higher.  It looks like it came right out of a storybook.  Excellent job with the setup and processing.  This is a very cool shot for the challenge.', '2008-10-13 01:07:41.000000', NULL, 0),
