(5005940, 728682, 75585, '<td valign="top">I would have thought you would get a top 5 with this - but top 10 is still amazing!  Tell Allie sorry that we didn''t do so well.... next time!!</td>', 'I would have thought you would get a top 5 with this - but top 10 is still amazing!  Tell Allie sorry that we didn''t do so well.... next time!!', '2008-10-13 01:18:52.000000', NULL, 0),
