(5005946, 727495, 42495, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote in the challenge and now I''m sorry that I didn''t - this would have been a 10 from me.  Excellent choice to use B&amp;W.  I sure hope you make a big print of this and display it on a prominent place.  Congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'I didn''t vote in the challenge and now I''m sorry that I didn''t - this would have been a 10 from me.  Excellent choice to use B&W.  I sure hope you make a big print of this and display it on a prominent place.  Congrats on the ribbon.', '2008-10-13 01:22:50.000000', NULL, 0),
