(5005969, 727993, 42013, '<td valign="top">Way to go Marac! This is freakin <strike>funny</strike> strange!?! :)</td>', 'Way to go Marac! This is freakin funny strange!?! :)', '2008-10-13 01:34:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5005977, 728742, 19982, '<td valign="top">What a GORGEOUS scene you have depicted.<br/> <br/>You know... I''ve often thought that artists were lucky because they could paint whatever they could dream.  Meanwhile, us photographers are stuck with taking pictures of whatever we can find.  Your picture looks, to me, like something right out of an artist''s dream.<br/> <br/>Way to go!<br/> <br/>P.S.<br/>The wonderful 3-D effect you have achieved in this image is absolutely amazing!<br/> <br/></td>', 'What a GORGEOUS scene you have depicted. You know... I''ve often thought that artists were lucky because they could paint whatever they could dream.  Meanwhile, us photographers are stuck with taking pictures of whatever we can find.  Your picture looks, to me, like something right out of an artist''s dream. Way to go! P.S.The wonderful 3-D effect you have achieved in this image is absolutely amazing! ', '2008-10-13 01:36:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5005978, 727703, 96534, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Joanne, it is a beautiful shot, my favourite. Now I''ve been busting to ask you how you achieved the Breugel like quality - could you please tell me/us how you did the post processing, or was it all in the lighting?</td>', 'Congratulations Joanne, it is a beautiful shot, my favourite. Now I''ve been busting to ask you how you achieved the Breugel like quality - could you please tell me/us how you did the post processing, or was it all in the lighting?', '2008-10-13 01:36:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5005979, 727495, 63503, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your first ribbon and a great score. Truly a stunning image.</td>', 'Congratulations on your first ribbon and a great score. Truly a stunning image.', '2008-10-13 01:37:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5005982, 728615, 30982, '<td valign="top">And the peepcock is dethroned!  Excellent image from concept through execution.  Nothing against the first place shot (you know me and B&amp;W) but this was my top pick for the challenge by a long shot - simply perfect for the challenge.  Could be used as a movie poster!  Love the bit about the big toe.... I''ll have to try that some day.</td>', 'And the peepcock is dethroned!  Excellent image from concept through execution.  Nothing against the first place shot (you know me and B&W) but this was my top pick for the challenge by a long shot - simply perfect for the challenge.  Could be used as a movie poster!  Love the bit about the big toe.... I''ll have to try that some day.', '2008-10-13 01:38:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5005985, 728682, 96534, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a gorgeous shot. You pipped me by one place lol, but VERY well deserved - I would have thought it would make a ribbon! What did you do in post processing? - I love the effects you have achieved.</td>', 'Congratulations on a gorgeous shot. You pipped me by one place lol, but VERY well deserved - I would have thought it would make a ribbon! What did you do in post processing? - I love the effects you have achieved.', '2008-10-13 01:39:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5005988, 728701, 96534, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on making top 10, its a great shot. Would you mind telling me which skin softening filter are you using???</td>', 'Congratulations on making top 10, its a great shot. Would you mind telling me which skin softening filter are you using???', '2008-10-13 01:41:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5005989, 728673, 49643, '<td valign="top">Stunning!! Congratulations on the HM!</td>', 'Stunning!! Congratulations on the HM!', '2008-10-13 01:42:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5005991, 728123, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very clever and well executed - nice to see a vision carried through so well!  I did have to laugh about the part "all I did was..." in your editing steps... That''s more editing than I do in a month!  Congratulations on an excellent score and placement.</td>', 'Very clever and well executed - nice to see a vision carried through so well!  I did have to laugh about the part "all I did was..." in your editing steps... That''s more editing than I do in a month!  Congratulations on an excellent score and placement.', '2008-10-13 01:43:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5005994, 728734, 42013, '<td valign="top">This wasn''t what I pictured when I heard you won the brown. Made me laugh and kudos to you for not taking it too seriously!</td>', 'This wasn''t what I pictured when I heard you won the brown. Made me laugh and kudos to you for not taking it too seriously!', '2008-10-13 01:43:55.000000', NULL, 0),
