(5006007, 727495, 52549, '<td valign="top">This is one of the most beautiful images I''ve ever seen. Congrats on your well deserved win and your new PB.</td>', 'This is one of the most beautiful images I''ve ever seen. Congrats on your well deserved win and your new PB.', '2008-10-13 01:48:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(5006013, 728682, 69668, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jettyimages:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations on a gorgeous shot. You pipped me by one place lol, but VERY well deserved - I would have thought it would make a ribbon! What did you do in post processing? - I love the effects you have achieved. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for the comments.  I reduced noise twice in photoshop, then history brushed back over the models.  That is it for the background.</td>', 'Originally posted by jettyimages: Congratulations on a gorgeous shot. You pipped me by one place lol, but VERY well deserved - I would have thought it would make a ribbon! What did you do in post processing? - I love the effects you have achieved.   Thanks for the comments.  I reduced noise twice in photoshop, then history brushed back over the models.  That is it for the background.', '2008-10-13 01:51:59.000000', NULL, 0),
