(5017415, 728738, 62318, '<td valign="top">For your second entry, I think it was well done. The technicals might not be spot on, but I personally like the slight blur. Gives it more of that "falling" feeling, like she is dropping the apple. I am a big fan of the simple tones. Hope to see in more challenges in the coming months.</td>', 'For your second entry, I think it was well done. The technicals might not be spot on, but I personally like the slight blur. Gives it more of that "falling" feeling, like she is dropping the apple. I am a big fan of the simple tones. Hope to see in more challenges in the coming months.', '2008-10-21 01:36:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5019741, 728655, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL - I realize it wasn''t very funny at the time, but the old codger''s comments remind me that we probably do look kinda silly when we''re doing stuff for challenges!  Probably hard for some people to understand.  And I thought the wolf was a nifty touch.  Very good job getting the setting to match in scale to to the figures, too!</td>', 'LOL - I realize it wasn''t very funny at the time, but the old codger''s comments remind me that we probably do look kinda silly when we''re doing stuff for challenges!  Probably hard for some people to understand.  And I thought the wolf was a nifty touch.  Very good job getting the setting to match in scale to to the figures, too!', '2008-10-22 03:42:56.000000', NULL, 0),
